    "accepted": "Provider accepted ID only, never delivered.",
    "retry": "Only explicit definite not-sent, max3 handoffs; 60/300 seconds minimum plus24h and3/7d conservative frequency barrier. Unknown/timeouts never automatically resent.",
    "handoff": "Authority/preference/contact/source/frequency revalidated under locks before committed sending. Confirmed in-flight handoff is not recalled by opt-out.",
    "capability": "Random256-bit token, hashed purpose/protocol/expiry;30d technical expiry; preference/contact change invalidates. No authenticated response returns token."
  },
  "operational_limits": "24h+3/7d,15min source freshness,60s lease,100 open intents and30d exclusion expiry are internal technical safeguards, not commercial/retention policy. No live sends/cargos/provider verification claimed."
